cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

title: "ED Digital Twin (10-Minute Resolution)"
abstract: >
  A database-driven discrete-event digital twin of an Emergency Department,
  forecasting patient arrivals and discharges over a 12-hour horizon at
  10-minute resolution. The model fits statistical distributions for
  length-of-stay and arrival rates from historical visit data, then runs
  stochastic forward simulations with validation against observed patient flow.

